## 🚀 How to Use the Dashboard

1. Download or clone the project repository.
2. Open the Power BI `.pbix` file using Power BI Desktop.
3. Explore the overall sales KPIs.
4. Apply date, category, fulfilment, and shipping-state filters.
5. Compare category-wise revenue and order status.
6. Analyse product sizes and detailed sales records.

